WEBVTT

00:24:26.756 --> 00:24:31.316
What worries you about the future
that we're facing?

00:24:32.396 --> 00:24:36.276
AF: Well, just some of the things
that you mentioned.

00:24:36.876 --> 00:24:43.796
We do have a growing element
of anti-science in society.

00:24:44.396 --> 00:24:46.796
Disturbingly,

00:24:46.836 --> 00:24:48.676
growing in the United States.

00:24:49.276 --> 00:24:52.916
And when I talk to my colleagues
internationally,

00:24:52.956 --> 00:24:57.316
depending upon the country
that they live in

00:24:57.316 --> 00:24:59.396
to a greater or lesser degree,

00:24:59.436 --> 00:25:01.196
there's some element of that.